{"accessed_at":"2026-11-08T06:01:26.214Z","result":"105411.fm (https://www.merckmillipore.com/deepweb/assets/sigmaaldrich/product/documents/127/284/105411-mk.pdf)\nciteturn86view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 1; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.merckmillipore.com/deepweb/assets/sigmaaldrich/product/documents/127/284/105411-mk.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 50\nL0@P0: 1 Merck Microbiology Manual 12th Edition\nL1@P0: Reinforced Clostridial Medium (RCM)\nL2@P0: Medium proposed by HIRSCH and GRINSTED (1954) for the cultivation and enumeration of clostridia, other anaerobes\nL3@P0: and facultative microorganisms in foodstuffs and other materials.\nL4@P0: EPA\nL5@P0: EP\nL6@P0: USP\nL7@P0: JP\nL8@P0: This medium complies with the recommendations of the\nL9@P0: harmonized method in the Ph.Eur. 5.6 and the USP 29 (2006).\nL10@P0: Mode of Action\nL11@P0: See Reinforced Clostridial Agar.\nL12@P0: Typical Composition (g/litre)\nL13@P0: Meat extract 10.0; Peptone 10.0; yeast extract 3.0; D(+)glucose\nL14@P0: 5.0; starch 1.0; sodium chloride 5.0; sodium acetate 3.0;\nL15@P0: L-cysteinium chloride 0.5; agar-agar 0.5\nL16@P0: Preparation\nL17@P0: Dissolve 38 g/litre, dispense into test tubes, autoclave (15 min at\nL18@P0: 121 \u001fC). Cool, if required add 0.02 g Polymyxin B/litre in form\nL19@P0: of an aqueous solution and mix.\nL20@P0: pH: 6.8 ± 0.2 at 25 \u001fC.\nL21@P0: The prepared medium in the tubes is clear and yellowish.\nL22@P0: Experimental Procedure and Evaluation\nL23@P0: After inoculation it is advised to cover the medium with a layer\nL24@P0: of paraffin viscous or agar.\nL25@P0: Incubation: 24-48 hours at 35 \u001fC anaerobically.\nL26@P0: Count the colonies which have grown and, if necessary, perform\nL27@P0: further tests.\nL28@P0: Literature\nL29@P0: HIRSCH, A., a. GRINSTED, E.: Methods for the growth and enumeration of\nL30@P0: anaerobic sporeformers from cheese, with observations on the effect of nisin.\nL31@P0: ñ J. Dairy Res., 21; 101-110 (1954).\nL32@P0: European Pharmacopeia 5.6, Chapter 2.6.13 B (Harmonized Method)\nL33@P0: United States Pharmacopeia 29-NF 24, Chapter <62>\nL34@P0: Ordering Information\nL35@P0: Quality control\nL36@P0: Product Merck Cat. No. Pack size\nL37@P0: Reinforced Clostridial\nL38@P0: Medium (RCM)\nL39@P0: 1.05411.0500 500 g\nL40@P0: Paraffin viscous 1.07160.1000 1 l\nL41@P0: Polymyxin-B-sulfate EMD Biosciences\nL42@P0: Test strains Inoculum [CFU] Growth\nL43@P0: Clostridium sporogenes ATCC 11437 10-100 good / very good\nL44@P0: Clostridium perfringens ATCC 10453 10-100 good / very good\nL45@P0: Clostridium perfringens ATCC 13124 10-100 good / very good\nL46@P0: Clostridium sporogenes ATCC 19404 10-100 good / very good\nL47@P0: Clostridium novyi 17861 10-100 good / very good\nL48@P0: Staphylococcus aureus ATCC 25923 10-100 good / very good\nL49@P0: Escherichia coli ATCC 25922 10-100 good / very good\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn86view1 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.biomerieux.com/content/dam/biomerieux-com/under-construction/brazil/lista-de-produtos-registrado-na-anvisa/Lista-de-Produtos-Registrados-na-ANVISA-20-02-2026-0929-h.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); \nFailed to fetch https://www.biomerieux.com/content/dam/biomerieux-com/under-construction/brazil/lista-de-produtos-registrado-na-anvisa/Lista-de-Produtos-Registrados-na-ANVISA-20-02-2026-0929-h.pdf: (404) Not Found--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn86view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.jozo.or.jp/y62mxwe7/wp-content/uploads/4bfe78715d23b2e56441ea483503af72.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); \nFailed to fetch https://www.jozo.or.jp/y62mxwe7/wp-content/uploads/4bfe78715d23b2e56441ea483503af72.pdf: (403) Forbidden-------------------------------------------------------------------